Package: homelab-siem-scanner
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, curl, gnupg
Suggests: ufw, nmap, clamav, clamav-freshclam
Conflicts: homelab-siem-scanner-full
Description: Lightweight Wazuh Manager orchestrator
 Installs an explicit setup utility for deploying Wazuh Manager without
 Wazuh Indexer, Dashboard, OpenSearch, Elastic, or Grafana.
 .
 Installation does not automatically change firewall policy or deploy
 external software.

Package: homelab-siem-scanner-full
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ca-certificates, curl, gnupg
Suggests: ufw
Conflicts: homelab-siem-scanner
Description: Optional complete Wazuh SIEM orchestrator
 Installs an explicit setup utility for deploying Wazuh Manager, Wazuh
 Indexer, and Wazuh Dashboard using the official Wazuh installation
 assistant.
 .
 This package requires significantly more system resources than the
 manager-only package.
